# GSE52778 RNA-Seq Differential Expression Pipeline

## Project Summary

This repository contains an automated, reproducible Python pipeline designed for end-to-end transcriptomic analysis. The workflow processes raw RNA-Seq count data from the NCBI GEO dataset GSE52778, performs quality control and size-factor normalization, fits a generalized linear model using PyDESeq2, and identifies statistically significant differentially expressed genes. It utilizes pandas, scikit-learn, and seaborn to generate analytical insights and visual outputs.

## Replication Guide

### Prerequisites

Ensure you have Python 3.10 or higher installed on your system.

### Installation

Clone this repository and install the required core packages via your terminal:

```bash
pip install pydeseq2 pandas numpy matplotlib seaborn scikit-learn
Data Setup
Place your extracted raw count matrix file inside the data/ folder.

If no metadata file is provided, the script will automatically generate a balanced experimental design matrix (metadata.csv) inside the data/ folder.

Execution
Run the main script from your terminal:

Bash
python pipeline.py
This will parse the data, execute the DESeq2 statistical model, and export all results and plots directly into the outputs/ folder.

Results & Visualizations
Principal Component Analysis (PCA)
Global sample variance and clustering based on log-transformed, size-factor normalized counts.

Volcano Plot
Differential expression significance mapping highlighting genes meeting the false discovery rate (padj < 0.05) and log2 fold-change thresholds (|LFC| > 1).

![PCA Plot](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jumonkey20/geo-rnaseq-pipeline/main/outputs/pca_plot.png)

![Volcano Plot](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jumonkey20/geo-rnaseq-pipeline/main/outputs/volcano_plot.png)

Project Structure
Plaintext
geo-rnaseq-pipeline/
│
├── data/                    # Raw count matrices and auto-generated metadata
│   └── metadata.csv         # Experimental design matrix
│
├── outputs/                 # Generated plots and analytical results
│   ├── pca_plot.png         # Sample-level PCA variance plot
│   ├── volcano_plot.png     # Differential expression volcano plot
│   └── differential_expression_results.csv # Full statistical table
│
├── pipeline.py              # Main automated execution script
└── README.md                # Project documentation
